{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03428","headline":"襄阳早秋寄岑侍郎 · 崔湜","name":"襄阳早秋寄岑侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江城秋气早，旭旦坐南闱。\n落叶惊衰鬓，清霜换旅衣。\n时来矜早达，事往觉前非。\n体道徒推理，防身终昧微。\n故人金华省，肃穆秉天机。\n谁念江汉广，蹉跎心事违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}